WEBVTT

1
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:18,970
Where did you get these sea ropes? Where did you get them?

2
00:00:18,970 --> 00:00:19,970
Just in the sea

3
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,000
You boy are so lucky

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,120
Yesterday I got over a hundred kilograms of black eagle.

5
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:26,240
Now I got so much sea rope again

6
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,600
This is two hundred pounds, right? Master Qi

7
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:29,640
I'm just lucky

8
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,640
What you need when going to sea is good luck

9
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,600
How about everyone go to sea?

10
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:34,080
They all want to worship the Dragon King

11
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,960
Give way, give way, give way to Jianguo

12
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:40,610
I heard you got a sea rope and Jianguo?

13
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:41,730
Everyone is idle at my place

14
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,810
You don’t even need to shout when the boat is released, you just need to shout once

15
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:46,290
I brought them all here to help. The stuff is pretty good.

16
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:47,450
Just not big enough

17
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:49,250
If they were all of this quality in my hands

18
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:52,580
I'll give you the purchase price of 3.5 yuan per catty.

19
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:53,980
The price I gave is not low anymore

20
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:57,700
Go to the town or other docks and find out what the price is.

21
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:59,380
I am the only seafood purchasing point near Houhai Village.

22
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,380
Even if you drive a carriage

23
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:02,100
It would take more than half an hour at the earliest if he could wait.

24
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:03,180
But these sea ropes can't wait

25
00:01:03,180 --> 00:01:04,780
Everything is at this price

26
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:06,340
Sea Rope’s purchase price in the past three years

27
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:08,180
It's never been less than three and eight dollars.

28
00:01:08,180 --> 00:01:10,260
I'm obviously taking advantage of you by attacking you.
